  "sheets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "AT32 castellated core / pin contract v0.4",
      "notes": [
        "TOP VIEW 26x20mm; numbered clockwise. All components TOP. No assembly on bottom.",
        "Supply 5V via module pin2; V3V3 pin6 is output. USB ESD/protection on carrier.",
        "HOLD high=frozen, PEAK_RESET high=reset to BASE (nominal0.623V). 100k pull-ups on carrier.",
        "Positive peak: amplitude=PEAK_ADC minus event-before RAW_ADC baseline. BASE_ADC monitors nominal0.623V reference only; TRIG uses rising edge.",
        "USB clock uses HICK+ACC; no crystal. MCU 256KB CCT7; original firmware cannot be used unchanged.",
        "All four VDD plus VDDA supplied; analog and digital common solid ground."
      ]
    }
  ],
